# Two Bloodletters of Aclazotz under Bot1 both apply to one loss of life by Bot2. Bot2, the player whose life it is, chooses
# which applies first (CR 616.1); the second still applies to the event the first has doubled (CR 616.1f), and neither
# applies twice (CR 614.5). Lightning Bolt on Bot1's turn 5: 3 becomes 6 becomes 12 (20 -> 8).

